  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The bullet punches you in the stomach, penetrating into the abdominal cavity. Fortunately it was thus spent, failing to lacerate your intestines, instead nestling into the fatty tissue of the mesentery (the folds attaching the intestines to the abdominal wall).</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (3) and pass a <strong>Challenging (+0) Endurance</strong> Test or also gain @Condition[Prone]. As the bullet settles inside your body, a cyst forms, eventually encapsulating this foreign object. As this takes place, you contract a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.1hQuVFZt9QnnbWzg]{Minor Infection}. No Extraction is necessary or advisable.</p>"
    },
